Hello All,

Nupi EF Couplings and Saddles have what can be called pop up features that =
after fusion =93pop up=94 to indicate that a fusion has been executed.

The couplings have two of these and the saddles have one.  They are adjacen=
t to the electrodes.

They pop up  because  of the pressure that develops between the fitting and=
 the pipe.  They can pop up different heights.

That they pop up different heights has no meaning with respect to the quali=
ty of the fusion.

They are only meant to indicate that a fusion has been performed, or not, t=
hey are not meant to be a measure of the quality of the fusion.

John

--_000_9B7E2735CEC37E4D9137A9548F21D78372545FCA04MAIL_
